{"message":"I verified your account and checked your referral records. I found one referral still marked IN_PROGRESS from 11/13/2025, along with several older referrals marked COMPLETE. Approval and initial card use alone do not trigger the bonus—the referred customer must also meet the qualifying spend requirement within the required period.

For example, Silver Rewards Card referrals require $750 in spending within 60 days, and Platinum Rewards Card referrals require $1,500 within 90 days. Bonuses generally post after the requirement is met, often within one to two billing cycles depending on the card.

Please tell me which card your friend opened and the approximate application date. I can then explain the applicable requirement and whether the timing looks normal."}
